## Output Requirement

Output the plan as a JSON array of strings, where each string is one subtask. Example:

```json
[
  "Explore the authentication module to understand the current session handling logic",
  "Implement token refresh mechanism to handle expired sessions",
  "Add integration tests to verify session refresh behavior"
]
```

Only output the JSON code block. Do NOT include anything outside the JSON code block.
